<headline>FREE TO TRADE -- Braxton County, W.Va..</headline>
<text>
<p>BRAXTON COUNTY, WEST VIRGINIA</p>
<p>RE: $38,150,000</p>
<p>SOLID WASTE DISPOSAL VARIABLE-RATE DEMAND</p>
<p>REVENUE BONDS</p>
<p>(WEYERHAEUSER COMPANY PROJECT)</p>
